{"unit_id":"Guard42__dsh-humanize#card-zh","repo":"Guard42/dsh-humanize","commit":"18adeaf0f25862c21a0943539fda16345504deed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-humanize 是一款面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 Humanize 编码代理预设，通过 Flow 工具把多阶段目标组织成带验证条件的阶段图，并以不可变哈希锁定流程，在执行前经过评审。它支持草拟与检查流程、按依赖和条件调度子代理、记录事件并在中断后恢复，还可导出运行轨迹并进行哈希锚定文件编辑。适合需要拆解、验证和追踪复杂编码任务的 DSH 用户。安装后启动 DSH 会同步预设；无需额外 API Key，状态默认写入工作区的 .humanize 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/tool-flow.mjs:112-180","plugins/tool-flow.mjs:434-580","plugins/humanize-store.mjs:90-127","bridge/installer.mjs:61-85"]}
{"unit_id":"Guard42__dsh-humanize#card-en","repo":"Guard42/dsh-humanize","commit":"18adeaf0f25862c21a0943539fda16345504deed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-humanize is a coding preset for DeepSeek Harness. It creates verifiable multi-stage flows, locks plans by hash, and requires review before execution. It can resume interrupted runs, export traces, and make hash-checked edits. Startup syncs the preset; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/tool-flow.mjs:112-180","plugins/tool-flow.mjs:434-580","plugins/humanize-store.mjs:90-127","bridge/installer.mjs:61-85"]}
